  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDP III &#x2013; Support of global control and elimination targets of poverty related diseases</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project was implemented under the PDP III programme by the Drugs for Neglected Diseases initiative (DNDi). DNDi&apos;s mission is to improve the quality of life and the health of people suffering from neglected diseases, using an alternative model to develop drugs for these diseases and by ensuring equitable access to new and field-relevant health tools.</narrative>
  </description>
